'''Tania Richard''' was a [[Podracing|podracer]] [[pilot]] listed as the winner of a podrace at [[Grabvine Gateway]] in [[Baroonda (city)|Baroonda]]. When [[Syril Karn]] attempted to gain entry to the [[Imperial office complex]] on [[Ghorman]] after hours, the [[Unidentified Imperial office complex guard 1|two]] [[Unidentified Imperial office complex guard 2|guards]] were watching the podrace on a [[datapad]] screen, with [[Aurebesh]] text in the lower right hand corner indicating that Richard was the winner, followed by [[Marklus Sterner]] as number two, and [[Scott Pritchard (podracer)|Scott Pritchard]] in the third place.<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?">{{Andor|Ever Been to Ghorman?}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The character shares their name with [[imdb:nm1306326|Tania Richard]], an art director for [[Industrial Light & Magic|ILM's]] [[Wikipedia:Vancouver|Vancouver]] studio.<ref name="ILM">{{ILM|url=ilm-profiles-tania-richard|text=ILM Profiles: Tania Richard|date=2025-01-15|quote=Tania Richard had spent some 15 years working in visual effects before she joined ILM in 2018 as an art director at the Vancouver studio.}}</ref>

